---

## Test Path Conventions

### Unit Tests
- **Location**: `{{TEST_PATH}}/unit/`
- **Pattern**: `[feature].spec.ts` or `[feature].test.ts`
- **Purpose**: Test individual functions/classes in isolation

### Integration Tests
- **Location**: `{{TEST_PATH}}/integration/`
- **Pattern**: `[feature]-integration.spec.ts`
- **Purpose**: Test interactions between components

### E2E Tests
- **Location**: `{{TEST_PATH}}/e2e/`
- **Pattern**: `[workflow]-e2e.spec.ts`
- **Purpose**: Test complete user workflows

